        "text": "Great question! The pronunciation of \"doge\" is actually debated, much like the GIF debate. Here's a breakdown:\n\n---\n\n## How to Pronounce \"Doge\" \ud83d\udc15\n\n### The Most Widely Accepted Pronunciation (The Meme)\n",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": [
          {
            "cited_text": "The correct pronunciation of Dogecoin is \u201cdohj coin\u201d, which would be written as \u02c8d\u0259\u028a\u0292k\u0254\u026an using the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA). ",
            "encrypted_index": "Eo8BCioIEBgCIiRkMmJjZWZjOS0wNDQwLTQxYWUtOTM0Mi1hNDFhNjdkYWIzZWQSDNJo6v6u+uhbsklT5xoMcSfxeyJrkDhpZ7PYIjAydGGUISHlJCAt6zLW9r/YZlkK7AQORVTjCJLztNPAtIN3e+3LFaN6JO4Nrbw8f+sqE2mjqS6V4h8lj1oyPvAcy5UlEYsYBA==",
