            "url": "https://coincodex.com/article/25941/how-to-pronounce-dogecoin/"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The most widely accepted pronunciation of Doge (as in the meme/Dogecoin) is **\"dohj\"**, written as **\u02c8d\u0259\u028a\u0292** in the International Phonetic Alphabet.",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\nThis is the pronunciation you'll hear most often in media and online.\n\n---\n\n### Where Did This Come From?\n",
        "type": "text"
