            "title": "How to Pronounce Dogecoin? Here's the Right Way to Say It | CoinCodex",
            "type": "web_search_result_location",
            "url": "https://coincodex.com/article/25941/how-to-pronounce-dogecoin/"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This pronunciation was confirmed by Dogecoin's co-creator Jackson Palmer, who said the name was inspired by the animated series *Homestar Runner*. In one of the episodes, a character spells out D-O-G-E and another character reads it as \"dohj\" (d\u0259\u028a\u0292).",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\n---\n\n### All the Common Pronunciations\n\nThere are actually **three** pronunciations in common use:\n\n",
