            "cited_text": "According to Wikipedia, the meme can be pronounced /do\u028a\u0292/ or /do\u028ad\u0292/ or /do\u028a\u0261/, though all I&#x27;ve heard from the media is /do\u028a\u0292/. ",
            "encrypted_index": "Eo8BCioIEBgCIiRkMmJjZWZjOS0wNDQwLTQxYWUtOTM0Mi1hNDFhNjdkYWIzZWQSDHw1tVTYw++EME9SpxoMJsAlK29ukTRJEy2rIjDWISmKCHoRECYWy9NNPwtiPXa/dtSegGESBJU/A596Qq228NN5ZDL4hztMZZUBdPQqEx8s4Jcpl1p5nZSZHFrKZEArkOAYBA==",
