        "text": "According to Wikipedia, the meme can be pronounced **/do\u028a\u0292/** (\"dohzh\"), **/do\u028ad\u0292/** (\"dohj\"), or **/do\u028a\u0261/** (\"dohg\"), though most media uses /do\u028a\u0292/.",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\n| Pronunciation | Sounds Like | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| **dohzh** (/do\u028a\u0292/) | Rhymes with *beige* | Most common in media |\n| **dohj** (/do\u028ad\u0292/) | Rhymes with *dodge* (but with a long O) | Confirmed by the meme's creator |\n| **dohg** (/do\u028a\u0261/) | Like \"dog\" with a long O | Based on spelling logic |\n\n---\n\n### Common Mispronunciations to Avoid\n",
        "type": "text"
